            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P4-T2-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M0PD7Q2KJTW26YHEA899XTZH>
              Focused and workflow suites, type/build, frozen install, package identity, strict Codument, XNL/XML and diff checks pass.
              </?01M0PD7Q2KJTW26YHEA899XTZH>
              <Criterion #P4-T2-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0PD7Q2KJTW26YHEA899XTZJ>
